# Never upload local env files to Vercel builds.
# Vercel env vars (set via dashboard or `vercel env add`) are the source of truth.
# A stale or partial .env.local can shadow process.env during the build,
# silently breaking NEXT_PUBLIC_* tracking IDs (see 2026-04-11 incident).
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test
